{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：10:10 2026-06-29 HKT<br/>發佈時間：10:10 2026-06-29 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：10:10 2026-06-29 HKT</p><p>今(29日)早上9時42分，何文田自由道4號一地盤，一部吊起鐵通的挖泥機突翻側，鐵通墮下壓著一名姓陳男工，他當場頭部重創昏迷，救護員接報到場，將他送往廣華醫院，經搶救後證實死亡，另有一名男工人受傷清醒同送廣華醫院治理。勞工處接報後已即時派員到現場，現正就意外原因展開調查。</p><img alt=\"重創工人送院死亡。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/d1ebda50d9de9cc5609e85042ce45929/2026-06/WhatsApp_Image_2026-06-29_at_11_23_50_1_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"現場為何文田自由道4號一地盤。江雪晴攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/b9a30ca70027ab83df89ed7a52646ebc/2026-06/WhatsApp_Image_2026-06-29_at_10_29_07_2_.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/32ebcbbe16f6ca3c7b82ddae6457325b/2026-06/WhatsApp_Image_2026-06-29_at_10_29_07_1_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"挖泥機翻側。江雪晴攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/e32b47c43b36be09634c05d7f008a55c/2026-06/WhatsApp_Image_2026-06-29_at_10_29_07.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/00e19688cdc6f8ec9d32550e657fc4b9/2026-06/WhatsApp_Image_2026-06-29_at_10_29_06.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/1b5b8eb65b035cfc94bdc8a349639fc5/2026-06/WhatsApp_Image_2026-06-29_at_10_29_05.jpeg\"/><p>據了解，姓陳（40歲）死者，未婚，與母親同住。他為地盤雜工，在上址工作僅數日。</p><img alt=\"挖泥機翻側。梁國峰攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/9dc5b4a3d79414580520e0fa58119e55/2026-06/WhatsApp_Image_2026-06-29_at_10_47_30_2__0.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/5bd687ff899390ffe97215358975d8e2/2026-06/WhatsApp_Image_2026-06-29_at_10_47_32.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/2cfae5f18eb0c8921233d0e281ed483c/2026-06/WhatsApp_Image_2026-06-29_at_10_47_30.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"鐵通墮下散滿地。梁國峰攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/c49b7eb0a20fe56d2c457899f54020d6/2026-06/WhatsApp_Image_2026-06-29_at_10_47_14.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"警員到場調查。梁國峰攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/69386fdf697f46e92aaf666dc386ad3b/2026-06/WhatsApp_Image_2026-06-29_at_10_47_13_1_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"香港建造業總工會理事長周思傑（圖右）質疑施工管理有否事前做好風險評估。梁國峰攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/784842e31200b6a53024e11c5d38707a/2026-06/WhatsApp_Image_2026-06-29_at_10_34_58.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"工業傷亡權益會總幹事蕭倩文表示，半年以來，本港發生至少12宗奪命工業意外。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/8c13bcb34fc46942375259045fcabc82/2026-06/WhatsApp_Image_2026-06-29_at_11_13_10.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/3644b076c26532f273058423c320f4cf/2026-06/WhatsApp_Image_2026-06-29_at_11_30_33_1_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"當局派員到場調查。江雪晴攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/132b10185829115b15f21bb362bcbb6e/2026-06/WhatsApp_Image_2026-06-29_at_11_28_36.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"當局派員到場調查。江雪晴攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/ed697f7320493b27d601cb045f76912e/2026-06/WhatsApp_Image_2026-06-29_at_11_28_35_1_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"當局派員到場調查。江雪晴攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/171df049a6eb59622cb75b07a301840b/2026-06/WhatsApp_Image_2026-06-29_at_11_28_35.jpeg\"/><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-06-29T06:22:36.166869+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":259,"images":17,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none"}}